    The hook points the server serves to its dev API (plan_devapi_interfaces §2):
    interfaces over plain data. It references System.* only, so the dev API that
    links it can see nothing else of the game. SourceSharp.Server implements the
    hooks; Debug.Api.Server calls them. DebugApiClosureTests holds both
    rules from the built metadata and from this file.

    It sits beside the dev API, under its name, because it is the dev API's
    contract (plan_shim_areas_split phase 1): SourceSharp.Server.Interface is
    the name of the server's engine seams.
  -->
